      "category": "history",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 2,
      "text": "Early commerce relied on ferry wharves that linked Camden to Philadelphia and New York, moving cordwood, staves, grain, and Spanish‑oak bark.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
        19,
        20
      ],
      "sourceLabels": [
