      "category": "economy",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "text": "By 1917 the Victrolas factory in Camden churned out 500,000 records a year and even had its own recording studio.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
        8
      ],
      "sourceLabels": [
        "Web source 1"
      ],
      "source": "https://secretsofphiladelphia.com/2024/10/31/history-along-the-delaware-camden-a-city-through-time/",
      "category": "economy",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 4,
      "text": "The Camden Historic District preserves structures like the 1810 Edward Smith summer house and a former factory now converted into apartments.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
